  "description": "Unofficial, type-safe .NET SDK for Flint (flint-chart), Microsoft's visualization language for AI agents. Build Flint ChartAssemblyInput chart specs in C# with a typed model or a fluent builder and serialize them to JSON with System.Text.Json; there are no other dependencies. flint-chart compiles that JSON to Vega-Lite, ECharts, Chart.js, Plotly or Excel charts. This package emits JSON only; it does not render charts. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.",
